== (3) lateral flare at the far end of a long shadow (the 45 m tower, 15 deg path sun, 1:500 DPR 2): the width of
   V < 0.5 across the shadow at distance t from the tower: the exact law, floor law c, and the interval-max variant
   (the verifier's VRC1-02 text: N = 32 samples, each the greatest height over its interval from the pyramid).
   t =  20.0 m: exact 6.091 m; law c 6.224 m (flare +1.0 px per side; the cell there 2 px, t/128 = 2 px); interval-max variant 16.950 m (flare +82.0 px per side)
