== (5) memory: the ring tiles' heights with their pyramid (⅓ MB per full-resolution tile, 4^-L at level L; ring j >= 2
   held from level floor(log2(4 (j - 1))), the finest any visible pixel resolves there by law c); a first ring and every ring out to k
   reference view DPR 2: P = 35 (a 7, b 5); first ring 9.33 MB, all rings to k = 64 11.82 MB (bound (2(a + b) + 4)/3 + 3 = 12.33); visible pyramids P/12 = 2.92 MB; need 155.8 + 2.92 + 12.33 = 171.0 MB
   reference view DPR 1.5: P = 24 (a 6, b 4); first ring 8.00 MB, all rings to k = 64 10.32 MB (bound (2(a + b) + 4)/3 + 3 = 11.00); visible pyramids P/12 = 2.00 MB; need 109.0 + 2.00 + 11.00 = 122.0 MB
